    <item>
      <title>1. Giới thiệu Phát triển bền vững và Biến đổi khí hậu</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/onlinecourse/course/suscc/1_intro/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 20 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/onlinecourse/course/suscc/1_intro/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Các vấn đề môi trường, khái niệm về phát triển bền vững.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;các-vấn-đề-môi-trường-toàn-cầu&#34;&gt;Các vấn đề môi trường toàn cầu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Hãy tương tác với các biểu đồ dưới đây để hiểu rõ hơn các vấn đề môi trường toàn cầu qua dữ liệu.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;dân-số-tăng-trưởng&#34;&gt;Dân số tăng trưởng&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;iframe src=&#34;https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/population-regions-with-projections?time=1400..latest&amp;tab=chart&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; style=&#34;width: 100%; height: 600px; border: 0px none;&#34; allow=&#34;web-share; clipboard-write&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;trái-đất-của-chúng-ta-có-thể-phục-vụ-bao-nhiêu-người&#34;&gt;Trái đất của chúng ta có thể phục vụ bao nhiêu người?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;

 

&lt;div class=&#34;hb-columns hb-columns-2&#34;&gt;
  

&lt;div class=&#34;hb-column&#34;&gt;
  &lt;strong&gt;Biocapacity&lt;/strong&gt;
















&lt;figure  id=&#34;figure-source-global-footprint-networkhttpswwwfootprintnetworkorgwhat-biocapacity-measures-wwwfootprintnetworkorg&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;d-flex justify-content-center&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.footprintnetwork.org/content/uploads/2025/07/Biocapacity-2025.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Source: [Global Footprint Network](https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-biocapacity-measures/), www.footprintnetwork.org&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;
      Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-biocapacity-measures/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Global Footprint Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.footprintnetwork.org&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;www.footprintnetwork.org&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

On the supply side, Biocapacity stands for the regenerative capacity of our planet’s ecosystems.
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;div class=&#34;hb-column&#34;&gt;
  &lt;strong&gt;Ecological footprint&lt;/strong&gt;
















&lt;figure  id=&#34;figure-source-global-footprint-networkhttpswwwfootprintnetworkorgwhat-ecological-footprints-measure-wwwfootprintnetworkorg&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;d-flex justify-content-center&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.footprintnetwork.org/content/uploads/2025/07/Ecological-Footprint-2025.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Source: [Global Footprint Network](https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-ecological-footprints-measure/), www.footprintnetwork.org&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;
      Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-ecological-footprints-measure/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Global Footprint Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.footprintnetwork.org&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;www.footprintnetwork.org&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

On the demand side, The Ecological Footprint is a metric of human demand on ecosystems
&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;/div&gt;

