    <item>
      <title>2. Môi trường tự nhiên và hệ sinh thái</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/onlinecourse/course/suscc/2_ecology/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 25 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/onlinecourse/course/suscc/2_ecology/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Giới thiệu về sinh quyển, hệ sinh thái, và các vòng tuần hoàn sinh địa hóa&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tài-liệu&#34;&gt;Tài liệu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Đọc tài liệu: &lt;a href=&#34;https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/textbooks/96&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Theis, T., &amp;amp; Tomkin, J. (2015). Sustainability: A Comprehensive Foundation. OpenStax CNX. &lt;strong&gt;Chapter 4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;dịch-vụ-hệ-sinh-thái&#34;&gt;Dịch vụ hệ sinh thái&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;khái-niệm-về-kinh-tế-sinh-thái&#34;&gt;Khái niệm về kinh tế sinh thái&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  id=&#34;figure-the-economic-subsystem-relative-to-the-global-ecosystem-apdapted-from-goodland-et-al-1992-source-mikhail-ryazanov--wikimedia-commonshttpscommonswikimediaorgwikifilediagram_of_natural_resource_flows-ensvg&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;d-flex justify-content-center&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/94/Diagram_of_natural_resource_flows-en.svg&#34; alt=&#34;The Economic Subsystem Relative to the Global Ecosystem, Apdapted from Goodland et al., 1992. Source: [Mikhail Ryazanov / Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Diagram_of_natural_resource_flows-en.svg)&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;
      The Economic Subsystem Relative to the Global Ecosystem, Apdapted from Goodland et al., 1992. Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Diagram_of_natural_resource_flows-en.svg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Mikhail Ryazanov / Wikimedia Commons&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;dịch-vụ-hệ-sinh-thái-1&#34;&gt;Dịch vụ hệ sinh thái&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  id=&#34;figure-the-links-between-ecosystem-services-and-human-well-being-as-described-by-millennium-ecosystem-assessment-2005-source-philippe-rekacewicz-emmanuelle-bournay-unepgrid-arendalhttpswwwgridanoresources6075&#34;&gt;
